<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">MOVEMENT REPORT</view><view class="title">{{isReport?'训练报告':self?'本次训练':'学生训练详情'}}</view><view class="subtitle">{{isReport?'回顾已归档的训练表现':'当前课堂快照，训练尚未归档'}}</view><demo-notice/><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" bindtap="refresh">{{error}} · 点击重试</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在整理训练表现…</view><block wx:if="{{student}}">
<view class="card hero"><view class="row"><view class="avatar">{{student.initial}}</view><view class="grow"><view class="name">{{student.name}} · {{actionName}}</view><view class="subtitle">{{date}}</view></view><text class="pill">{{isReport?'已归档':'进行中快照'}}</text></view><view class="report-score"><text>{{student.score}}</text><text class="report-score-unit">/ 100</text></view><view class="row"><view class="subtitle">动作质量评分</view><text class="comparison-pill">{{comparison}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{previousDate}}" class="report-caption">对比上一条同项目记录 · {{previousDate}}</view></view>
<view class="card goal-card"><view class="goal-ring"><training-chart model="{{completionChart}}" height="260"/></view><view class="grow"><view class="name">这一组，完成了多少？</view><view class="goal-count">{{student.reps}}<text> / {{student.target_reps}} 次</text></view><view class="muted">记录中的动作事件 {{eventCount}} 次</view></view></view><view class="section">五维动作画像 <text class="section-note">0–100 归一化分数</text></view><view class="card"><training-chart model="{{radarChart}}" height="470"/><view class="dimension-grid"><view wx:for="{{metrics}}" wx:key="label"><view class="muted">{{item.label}}</view><text class="name">{{item.value}} / 100</text></view></view><view class="hint">ROM与速度为样例归一化分数，不是关节角度或物理速度。</view></view><view class="section">需要留意的细节</view><view class="card"><view wx:for="{{student.errors}}" wx:key="code" class="list-row row"><view class="grow"><view class="name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="muted">记录中的动作事件，供教师复核</view></view><text class="pill attention">{{item.count}} 次</text></view><view wx:if="{{!student.errors.length}}" class="empty">本条记录暂无动作事件<view>继续在后续训练中观察</view></view></view><button class="secondary" bindtap="tutorial">先看看这个动作怎么做</button><button class="primary" bindtap="portrait">查看个人运动趋势 →</button><button wx:if="{{self}}" class="secondary" bindtap="advice">整理下一次训练重点</button><view class="hint">报告展示结构化训练记录，不由小程序进行动作推理；样例不能作为人体算法验收。</view></block></view>
